    {
      "index": 18,
      "section": "Section 5 \u2014 Patch Walkthrough",
      "slide_id": "05d-modulator-c",
      "heading": "Step 4: Modulator C feeding B",
      "cue_id": "op-poly-bell-step4",
      "kind": "operator-demo",
      "narration_before": "Step four. Operator C now feeds B \u2014 that's already wired by algorithm one. We just configure it. Coarse seven. That puts C up at seven times the carrier frequency. Level fifty percent. Envelope: same shape as B, but decay sixty milliseconds \u2014 even shorter. C is a high-frequency shimmer painted across the front of B's envelope. Listen.",
