    {
      "index": 20,
      "section": "Section 5 \u2014 Patch Walkthrough",
      "slide_id": "05f-spread-filter",
      "heading": "Step 6: Spread + Filter",
      "cue_id": "op-poly-bell-step6",
      "kind": "operator-demo",
      "narration_before": "Step six. Stereo and filter. Spread to twelve percent. Remember Spread is two semi-independent voice instances, hard-panned, detuned. At twelve percent the patch widens noticeably without phasing artifacts. Filter on. Low-pass twenty-four dB per octave. Circuit set to OSR \u2014 the Oxford OSCar model with diode-clipped resonance. Cutoff eight kilohertz. Drive plus three dB. Listen.",
