      "slide_id": "05g-velocity",
      "heading": "Step 7: Velocity Routing",
      "cue_id": "beep-street-velocity",
      "kind": "song-clip",
      "narration_before": "mbre. No external automation, no MIDI CC tricks \u2014 the synthesis topology *itself* responds dynamically. Squarepusher built a career on that response. *Beep Street*, from *Hard Normal Daddy*, nineteen-ninety-seven \u2014 Tom Jenkinson told Sound on Sound his FM workhorses are a Yamaha TX81Z and an FS1R. Listen to the lead before the drums hit, and notice the louder notes break open with a metallic edge.",
