    {
      "index": 24,
      "section": "Section 6 \u2014 IDM Application",
      "slide_id": "06a-rhythmic-fm",
      "heading": "Rhythmic FM via Loop Modes",
      "cue_id": "bike-fm-perc",
      "kind": "song-clip",
      "narration_before": "that evolves with parameter changes \u2014 where every knob is a compositional decision, not just a sound-design one. This is not hypothetical. Autechre's *Bike* \u2014 and it is on *Incunabula*, nineteen-ninety-three, not *Tri Repetae*, whatever the forums tell you \u2014 opens with exactly this. Metallic clicks, each one a short modulator envelope ringing a carrier at a ratio that lands on no musical interval.",
